              "fix_steps": "1. Confirm the email on file with list_customer_orders. 2. Trigger \"Forgot password\" and ask the customer to read the 6-digit OTP to the agent. 3. If the lock persists after a correct OTP, create an account_access request with urgency=normal. 4. Never ask for the password itself and never read back an OTP the customer did not volunteer.",
